&\longrightarrow
\ket{S}\ket{0_\gamma}, \\
\ket{T_0}\ket{0_\gamma}
&\longrightarrow
\ket{S}\ket{1_\gamma}.\end{aligned}$ 线性性于是给出 $\ket{\Psi_{\mathrm{final}}}
=
\ket{S}\otimes
\frac{\ket{0_\gamma}+\ket{1_\gamma}}{\sqrt{2}}.$

