ja:
力を受けない質量 $m$ の通常の粒子に対して、古典的運動エネルギーは $H=\frac{p^2}{2m}.$ である。この二次形式は $p$ と $-p$ を対称に扱うので、左向きと右向きの粒子は同じ正のエネルギーをもつ。量子化は $p$ を演算子 $P$ に置き換える： $H=\frac{P^2}{2m}.$ $P=-i\hbar\,\partial_x$ を Schrödinger 方程式に代入する： $\begin{aligned}i\hbar\frac{\partial\psi}{\partial t}
&=
\frac{1}{2m}
\left(-i\hbar\frac{\partial}{\partial x}\right)^2
\psi \notag\\
&=
-\frac{\hbar^2}{2m}
\frac{\partial^2\psi}{\partial x^2}.
\end{aligned}$

zh:
对于质量为 $m$ 且不受力的普通粒子，经典动能为 $H=\frac{p^2}{2m}.$ 该二次型对 $p$ 和 $-p$ 的处理是对称的，因此向左运动和向右运动的粒子具有相同的正能量。量子化将 $p$ 替换为算符 $P$： $H=\frac{P^2}{2m}.$ 将 $P=-i\hbar\,\partial_x$ 代入 Schrödinger 方程： $\begin{aligned}i\hbar\frac{\partial\psi}{\partial t}
&=
\frac{1}{2m}
\left(-i\hbar\frac{\partial}{\partial x}\right)^2
\psi \notag\\
&=
-\frac{\hbar^2}{2m}
\frac{\partial^2\psi}{\partial x^2}.
\end{aligned}$

p.src:
A plane-wave component with momentum $p$ has energy $E(p)=\frac{p^2}{2m}.$ Unlike the linear case $E=cp$, the slope of this dispersion relation depends on $p$: $v_{\mathrm{group}}
=
\frac{dE}{dp}
=
\frac{p}{m}.$ Different momentum components of a localized packet therefore travel with different group velocities. Their relative phases change, the components separate, and the packet spreads. The decisive contrast is that $H=cP$ transports every shape rigidly, whereas $H=P^2/(2m)$ produces dispersive free-particle motion.

